   {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "p",
    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Today’s the Day launched in May 2020, and ran through the summer. It included Print, TV, OOH, performance, and social channels, a cameo voiceover by Spike Lee, and a call to action to do that thing you’ve always been curious about…and do it TODAY.</span></span>",
    "text": "Today’s the Day launched in May 2020, and ran through the summer. It included Print, TV, OOH, performance, and social channels, a cameo voiceover by Spike Lee, and a call to action to do that thing you’ve always been curious about…and do it TODAY.",
